1963, Contributi epigrafici agrigentini","Griffo, 1985","Cordiano, 1997, La ginnasiarchia nelle \"poleis\" dell'occidente mediterraneo antico","De Waele, 1971, Acragas Graeca: die historische Topographie des griechischen Akragas auf Sizilien. 1, Historischer Teil","Wilson, 1990, Sicily under the Roman Empire: the archaeology of a Roman province, 36 B.C. - A.D. 535","Fiorentini, 2009","De Miro, Fiorentini, 2010, Agrigento romana. Gli edifici pubblici civili","Fiorentini, 1996, Il ginnasio di Agrigento",[308,214,214,214,214,214,214,214,309,310,311,312,313,314,217,315,316,317,216],"R46KDTZX","SPPJMW9F","JH9U8UMU","MMVPCA5P","DBDJ7RGP","CXHAXNBQ","VF9MMBI9","4CB4RS5F","SWSRB88X","C3BPNMKF",[319,320,321,251,255,322,222,223,224,225,223,226,227,192],"isic001418","i.sicily inscription 001418",{"_":12},"sandstone","\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>Ε[ἰς \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Καίσαρα Αὔγουστον\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Καίσαρα\">Κ]αίσαρα\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Αὔγουστον\">Αὔγουστον\u003C/span>\u003C/span> φλάμενος \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Λουκίου Ἐγνατίου Λουκίου υἱοῦ Γαλερίᾳ\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Λουκίου\">Λουκίου\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Ἐγνατίου\">Ἐγνατίου\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Λουκίου\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"patronym\" data-text=\"Λουκίου\">[Λ]ου̣[κί]ου\u003C/span>\u003C/span> υἱοῦ Γαλ̣(ερίᾳ)\u003C/span> [\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gap\">---\u003C/span>] \u003Cbr id=\"al2-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"